@baseUrl = https://nodeapi.z76.vn/khotm
@qrCode = PL0000668102
@knownQrCode = PL0000198908

### Quét batch QR đang cần kiểm tra
POST {{baseUrl}}/phieuxuat/phu-lieu/kien/scan-batch
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrCodes": ["{{qrCode}}"]
}

### Quét batch QR đối chứng đã biết có dữ liệu
POST {{baseUrl}}/phieuxuat/phu-lieu/kien/scan-batch
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrCodes": ["{{knownQrCode}}"]
}

### Quét nhiều QR cùng lúc
POST {{baseUrl}}/phieuxuat/phu-lieu/kien/scan-batch
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrCodes": [
    "{{qrCode}}",
    "{{knownQrCode}}"
  ]
}

### Kiểm tra endpoint thông tin kiện riêng
POST {{baseUrl}}/getthongtinkien
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "QRCode": "{{qrCode}}"
}

### Tìm phiếu xuất phù hợp theo QR
POST {{baseUrl}}/phieuxuat/phu-lieu/tim-phieu-theo-kien
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrCodes": ["{{qrCode}}"]
}

###
GET https://nodeapi.z76.vn/khotm/btp/phieuxuat/list-kien